<title>NORWAY: Deminex drills dry well in North Sea.</title>
<headline>Deminex drills dry well in North Sea.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deminex Norge AS, as operator of exploration licence 166, has drilled a dry well in North Sea block 15/6 north of the Sleipner East field, the Norwegian Oil Directorate said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exploration well 15/6-8S was permanently plugged, the OD said.</p>
<p>Deminex holds 30 percent of licence 166 with Den norske stats oljeselskap AS holding the remaining 70 percent.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
